"role.tanukiParrot.name" : "Parrot Trainer"
"role.tanukiParrot.short" : "Parrot"
"role.tanukiParrot.blurb" : "Say that again!"
"role.tanukiParrot.generalBlurb" : "Say that again!"
"role.tanukiParrot.doc" : "A Crewmate role that can also be assigned as a Madmate.<br>Place parrots that record nearby living players for the configured duration and remember the latest five clips.<br>When a living player reenters range, the parrot plays one randomly selected clip."
"role.tanukiParrot.tips" : "・A new parrot must learn a voice before it can play anything.<br>・Your own voice is included. Parrot playback is never recorded directly.<br>・Remaining in range does not repeatedly trigger playback.<br>・Walls, distance, ghosts and private radio transmissions prevent recording.<br>・Meetings stop recording and playback, but completed clips and parrots remain.<br>・Death, disconnection or role removal clears your parrots.<br>・Requires compatible Tanuki BetterCrewLink clients, including the host."
"options.role.tanukiParrot.detail" : "Parrots remember nearby voices and repeat them to passersby."
"options.role.tanukiParrot.maximum" : "Maximum placed parrots"
"options.role.tanukiParrot.seconds" : "Recording duration per clip"
"options.role.tanukiParrot.cooldown" : "Placement cooldown"
"options.role.tanukiParrot.range" : "Parrot hearing and playback range"
"button.label.tanukiParrot.place" : "Place parrot"
